---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Mensagem recebida | D.Lab Experts"
  description="Sua mensagem chegou ao D.Lab Experts. Respondemos em até 1 dia útil com leitura do contexto e próximos passos."
>
  <section class="ty-hero">
    <div class="section-glow lilac" style="top:0;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:500px;height:400px"></div>
    <div class="section-glow green" style="bottom:0;right:-80px"></div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="ty-inner fi">
        <div class="ty-check">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" width="64" height="64" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="30" stroke="url(#g-green)" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.5"/>
            <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="30" stroke="url(#g-green)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="180 100" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M20 32 L28 40 L44 24" stroke="url(#g-green)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h1>Mensagem recebida.</h1>
        <p class="ty-sub">
          Obrigado pelo contato. Um analista sênior do D.Lab responde em até
          <strong>1 dia útil</strong>. Fique de olho na caixa de entrada e também
          na pasta de spam.
        </p>

        <div class="ty-next">
          <div class="label" style="margin-bottom:14px">Enquanto isso, explore</div>
          <div class="ty-ctas">
            <a href="/blog" class="btn btn-primary">Ler análises públicas →</a>
            <a href="/" class="btn btn-ghost">Voltar para a home</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .ty-hero {
    padding: 160px 0 140px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: calc(100vh - var(--nav-h) - 200px);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .ty-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .ty-check {
    display: inline-flex;
    width: 88px;
    height: 88px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(0, 229, 160, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 160, 0.15);
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .ty-inner h1 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.12;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .ty-sub {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
  }
  .ty-sub strong { color: var(--green); }
  .ty-next { padding-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .ty-ctas {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .ty-ctas { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
    .ty-ctas .btn { justify-content: center; }
  }
</style>
